{"id":"n61162-1-7","stage":3,"title":"뽀뽀 · 亲亲","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61162-1-7-1","ko":"너희 조카 정말 귀엽다.","zh":"你们的侄子真可爱。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너희","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们。","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"1","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}},{"text":"조카","meaning":"侄子、侄女、外甥、外甥女","explanation":"조카：侄子、侄女、外甥、外甥女。","readings":[{"term":"조카","audio":"/audio/f468453f8bc9c337dd97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91753","senseId":"1","lemma":"조카","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조카","audio":"/audio/f468453f8bc9c337dd97.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"귀엽다.","meaning":"可爱","explanation":"귀엽다：可爱；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"귀엽다","audio":"/audio/f6866c147cb407d922da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38323","senseId":"1","lemma":"귀엽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"귀엽다","audio":"/audio/f6866c147cb407d922da.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代多个听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"f468453f8bc9c337","term":"조카","zh":"侄子、侄女、外甥、外甥女","audio":"/audio/f468453f8bc9c337dd97.mp3","entryId":"91753","definition":"兄弟姐妹生的孩子。","pronunciation":["조카"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"f6866c147cb407d9","term":"귀엽다","zh":"可爱","audio":"/audio/f6866